{"type": "excalidraw", "version": 2, "source": "https://excalidraw.com", "elements": [{"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 20, "width": 612, "height": 30.0, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "C. Lo que se hizo sin red vuelve una sola vez", "fontSize": 24, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 24, "containerId": null, "originalText": "C. Lo que se hizo sin red vuelve una sola vez", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t0"}, {"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 56, "width": 554, "height": 16.25, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "PD-3 + PD-6. Siete casos. Protege los datos que solo existen en la escuela.", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "PD-3 + PD-6. Siete casos. Protege los datos que solo existen en la escuela.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t1"}, {"type": "line", "x": 10, "y": 88, "width": 1190, "height": 0, "strokeColor": "#d4d4d8", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "dashed", "roughness": 0, "roundness": null, "points": [[0, 0], [1190, 0]], "lastCommittedPoint": null, "startBinding": null, "endBinding": null, "startArrowhead": null, "endArrowhead": null, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "l2"}, {"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 108, "width": 122, "height": 21.25, "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "ITERACIÓN #1", "fontSize": 17, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 17, "containerId": null, "originalText": "ITERACIÓN #1", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t3"}, {"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 132, "width": 175, "height": 16.25, "strokeColor": "#868e96", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "El riesgo del reintento", "fontSize": 13, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 13, "containerId": null, "originalText": "El riesgo del reintento", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t4"}, {"type": "text", "x": 20, "y": 164, "width": 290, "height": 240.0, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "1. Diego termina una actividad un martes.\n   No hay Internet.\n\n2. El avance se guarda en una cola local,\n   dentro del nodo.\n\n3. El jueves vuelve la señal y la cola\n   sale hacia Lima.\n\n4. Si el envío se corta a mitad de camino,\n   el nodo reintenta. Ahí está el riesgo:\n   que el mismo avance quede registrado\n   dos veces.\n\n5. El avance de Diego no existe en ningún\n   otro lado del mundo.", "fontSize": 12, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "left", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 12, "containerId": null, "originalText": "1. Diego termina una actividad un martes.\n   No hay Internet.\n\n2. El avance se guarda en una cola local,\n   dentro del nodo.\n\n3. El jueves vuelve la señal y la cola\n   sale hacia Lima.\n\n4. Si el envío se corta a mitad de camino,\n   el nodo reintenta. Ahí está el riesgo:\n   que el mismo avance quede registrado\n   dos veces.\n\n5. El avance de Diego no existe en ningún\n   otro lado del mundo.", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t5"}, {"type": "rectangle", "x": 390, "y": 192, "width": 145, "height": 64, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "strokeWidth": 2, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": {"type": 3}, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "r6"}, {"type": "text", "x": 390, "y": 208.0, "width": 145, "height": 17.5, "strokeColor": "#1971c2", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "Diego", "fontSize": 14, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 14, "containerId": null, "originalText": "Diego", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t7"}, {"type": "text", "x": 390, "y": 227.5, "width": 145, "height": 12.5, "strokeColor": "#3f3f46", "strokeWidth": 1, "strokeStyle": "solid", "roughness": 1, "roundness": null, "text": "termina una actividad", "fontSize": 10, "fontFamily": 1, "textAlign": "center", "verticalAlign": "top", "baseline": 10, "containerId": null, "originalText": "termina una actividad", "lineHeight": 1.25, "seed": 1, "updated": 1725494400000, "link": null, "locked": false, "angle": 0, "opacity": 100, "groupIds": [], "boundElements": [], "fillStyle": "solid", "backgroundColor": "transparent", "id": "t8"}, {"type": "ellipse", "x": 590, "y": 182, "width": 158, "height": 